# NovaDrive Customer Audit Readout — May 2024
**Author:** Anna Becker, Quality Manager  
**Audience:** FastChip Executive Committee & Automotive Operations  
**Date:** May 13, 2024  

---

### Slide 1: Title & Executive Audit Outcome
- **Title:** NovaDrive On-Site Quality Audit — Final Readout & Commercial Release
- **Date Conducted:** May 12, 2024 | Location: FastChip HQ (Austin, TX) & Penang Fab (Remote)
- **Lead Auditors:** Klaus Meyer (Lead Supplier Quality Auditor, NovaDrive), Marcus Vance (VP Powertrain)
- **Executive Audit Outcome:**
  - **AUDIT RESULT: PASSED (GREEN STATUS)**
  - **Zero (0) Major Non-Conformances.**
  - **Two (2) Minor Observations (Both Contained On-Site).**
  - **Production Part Approval Process (PPAP Level 3): FORMALLY APPROVED.**
- *Speaker Notes:* "Yesterday's customer audit was a complete triumph. NovaDrive officially certified our quality systems and signed off on production release."

