### Slide 2: Audit Scope, Team & Execution Agenda
- **Audit Scope:** Complete review of Volta-7 product engineering, failure analysis rigor, 8D corrective actions, fab process SPC, and ATE test operations.
- **FastChip Defense Team:**
  - *Executive Lead:* Mike Chen (VP Product Engineering)
  - *Track 1 (QMS & 8D Verification):* Anna Becker, Tom Harris
  - *Track 2 (FA Lab & Physical Analysis):* Rosa Santos, Sara Nolan
  - *Track 3 (Test Floor & Lab Demonstration):* Emma White, Kevin Tran
  - *Track 4 (Fab & Assembly Process Control):* James Ortiz, Penang Fab Operations (Live Video Bridge)
